	"data": "Core Spatial Containers\n\nMaps the Core System's substrate architecture onto the OpenXR XR_EXT_spatial_container spec.\nRelated: [[concepts/core-system]] · [[concepts/room-2-0]] · [[concepts/ecs-linked-data-architecture]] · [[concepts/thought-bubbles]]\n\nThe Spec\n\nOpenXR 1.1.63 (ratified September 1, 2026) introduced three extensions that redefine how XR apps coexist:\nXR_EXT_spatial_container — multiple OpenXR applications from different engines coexist in shared physical space. The compositor…",
